Zara Zara guitar chords easy lesson from Bollywood Hindi movie Rehna Hai Tere Dil Mein (RHTDM) sung by Bombay Jayshree.

[Bm]Zara zara behekta hai, mehekta hai,        [A]Aaj toh mera
[Bm]Tan badan main pyasi hoon, mujhe var le,        [A]Apni bahon mein

[Bm]Zara zara behekta hai, mehekta hai,        [A]Aaj toh mera
[Bm]Tan badan main pyasi hoon, mujhe var le,        [A]Apni bahon mein

[Bm]Haan meri [A]kasam,        Tujhko [G]sanam
Door [A]kahin na [Bm]jaa,        Yeh [A]doori kehti [G]hai
Paas [A]mere aaja [Bm]re

[Bm]Yunhi garaj garaj kaali ghata barse,        [A]Hum yaar bheeg jayen
[Em]Is chahat ki baarish [Bm]mein,        [Bm]Meri khuli khuli laton ko suljhaye
[A]Tu apni ungliyon se,        [Em]Mein toh hoon isi khwahish [Bm]mein

